### Graphify ###
# Knowledge-graph state. Regenerate with: graphify update .
.graphify/
# Pre-0.17 layout, kept so an unmigrated tree stays ignored (see graphify migrate-state)
graphify-out/
# Installed CLI. The pin and lockfile ARE tracked; restore with:
#   cd tools/graphify && npm install --ignore-scripts
tools/graphify/node_modules/

### OpenCode Goal Plugin ###
.opencode/goals/

### OpenCode nested config guard ###
# A nested .opencode/ dir is created when opencode runs with a cwd inside
# .opencode/. Its node_modules/*.md files get registered as phantom agents.
.opencode/**/.opencode/
### Elevation of Privilege deck sources ###
# The Illustrator/InDesign native sources for the printed cards and box are ~86 MB
# and are never used to build anything here — the deck content comes from cards.yaml.
# The PDFs in docs/EoP_Microsoft_Docs/ ARE tracked; this one archive is not, so the
# clone stays small. Re-download from Microsoft if the artwork is ever needed:
#   https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=20303
docs/EoP_Microsoft_Docs/EoP_Cards_Box_Native_files.zip

# k6 run artefacts. Every load-test run writes a timestamped JSON pair here, so the
# directory would grow without bound. docs/performance/TRENDS.md is the curated
# record; the raw runs are local evidence. The directory itself stays tracked via
# its .gitkeep.
docs/performance/history/*.json
